          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since 75 < 150, Step 1 asks us to reverse the numbers and compute gcd(150, 75)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
