            0.828
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• Step 3 asks us to reduce the problem to computing gcd(75, 0)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.831,
            0.642,
            0.851
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• Since n = 0, Step 2 tells us the answer is 75."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.856,
            0.882,
            0.917
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In the example above, we reduced the problem 7 times before finding the answer. Are we close to our original goal of finding an algorithm where the effort is proportional to the number of digits? Unfortunately, no."
            }
          ]
        }
